    branchIfFlag: ch2_lent_tomek
    branchNodeId: tomek3_repay
    nextNodeId: tomek3_gone
  - nodeId: tomek3_sink
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Trzeci dzie\u0144 Tomka przy zlewie. Cztery st\u0142uczone talerze, patelnia w koszu na szklanki i woda na ca\u0142ej pod\u0142odze."
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Your man there is a bull in a china shop. Literally. In a china shop.
    - speakerId: tomek
      language: 0
      text: "Kuba, te kosze... Na budowie wszystko jest prostok\u0105tne. Tu nic do niczego nie pasuje."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - bull
    - shop
    - literally
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_your_man
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Zostaj\u0119 po zmianie i ucz\u0119 Tomka uk\u0142ada\u0107 kosz."
      targetNodeId: tomek3_teach
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "M\xF3wi\u0119 mu, \u017Ce musi sam. Ja te\u017C musia\u0142em."
      targetNodeId: tomek3_alone
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: tomek3_teach
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Do jedenastej w nocy: talerze bokiem, patelnie r\u0105czk\u0105 do ty\u0142u, szklanki dnem do g\xF3ry. Tomek uk\u0142ada kosz jak tynk: powoli, ale potem nic nie odpada."
    - speakerId: tomek
      language: 0
      text: "Wiesz co? Jak to u\u0142o\u017Cy\u0107 na p\u0142asko, to jest jak glazura. Kafelek przy kafelku."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch3_taught_tomek
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: -10
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 5
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: tomek3_end
  - nodeId: tomek3_alone
    lines:
    - speakerId: tomek
      language: 0
      text: "No tak. Ka\u017Cdy sam."
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Powiedzia\u0142em mu to, co kiedy\u015B kto\u015B powiedzia\u0142 mnie. Nie wiem, czy to m\u0105dro\u015B\u0107, czy tylko \u0142a\u0144cuch."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 5
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: tomek3_end
  - nodeId: tomek3_repay
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Wieczorem Tomek puka do pokoju. W r\u0119ce trzy banknoty po dziesi\u0119\u0107 euro i butelka \u017Bubr\xF3wki."
    - speakerId: tomek
      language: 0
      text: "M\xF3wi\u0142em: w pi\u0105tek. Marek za\u0142atwi\u0142 mi fuch\u0119 na Ballymun. P\u0142ac\u0105 pod sto\u0142em, ale p\u0142ac\u0105. A to na procent."
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Trzydzie\u015Bci euro wr\xF3ci\u0142o. Procent stoi na parapecie. W domu na dziewi\u0119\u0107 os\xF3b starczy na jeden wiecz\xF3r."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch3_tomek_repaid
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 30
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 5
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: tomek3_end
  - nodeId: tomek3_gone
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Materac Tomka jest pusty. Le\u017Cy na nim kartka."
    - speakerId: tomek
      language: 0
      text: "Przenios\u0142em si\u0119 do kumpla na Ballymun. Taniej. Nie gniewam si\u0119. Trzymaj si\u0119. T."
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Nie gniewa si\u0119. To gorzej, ni\u017C gdyby si\u0119 gniewa\u0142."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Wysy\u0142am mu SMS-a: \"Sorry, stary. Piwo na mnie.\""
      targetNodeId: tomek3_text
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Odk\u0142adam kartk\u0119 i id\u0119 spa\u0107."
      targetNodeId: tomek3_end
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: tomek3_text
    lines:
    - speakerId: tomek
      language: 0
      text: "Spoko. Trzymam za s\u0142owo."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch3_texted_tomek
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: -5
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: tomek3_end
  - nodeId: tomek3_end
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Dublin jest ma\u0142y. Wszyscy w ko\u0144cu spotykaj\u0105 si\u0119 przy tym samym zlewie, na tej samej budowie albo w tej samej kolejce na poczcie."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
